<title>UK: Delta pretax softens in 1996, payout flat.</title>
<headline>Delta pretax softens in 1996, payout flat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		15.2		   vs 20.0</p>
<p> Shr, pre exceps(pence) 22.8		   vs 26.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 14.4		   vs 14.4</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 18.9		   vs 18.9</p>
<p> Pretax, pre exceps     57.2		   vs 64.1</p>
<p> Pretax		     45.6		   vs 53.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   950		    vs 1,018.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Engineering products manufacturer and industrial services group Delta Plc said the abnormal copper price drop in June affected its turnover during 1996.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
</text>
